    "faq_lm1": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does the LM1 measure?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The LM1 uses Doppler radar to measure speed, up to 199 mph, and shows the result on its built-in display so you get feedback right after each swing.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I read the screen in bright sunlight?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The 400 × 300 LCD uses available ambient light rather than a backlight, so it stays clear and easy to read outdoors.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How many shots can it store?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The LM1 stores up to 500 shots, so you can review previous results and better understand your performance throughout a practice session.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_row_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is it powered?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It has a built-in rechargeable battery. Charge it, drop it in your golf bag and you're ready for your next session.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_row_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it work in hot or cold weather?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The LM1 operates from -4°F to 158°F and can be stored from -22°F to 176°F.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_row_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How big is it?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It measures 5.31 × 3.35 × 0.94 in and weighs 5.6 oz, compact enough to carry, set up and use whenever you're ready to practice, without adding unnecessary weight to your bag.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_row_7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your warranty and return policy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>[Warranty and returns details to be added.]</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_row_radar": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Doppler radar and why does the LM1 use it?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Doppler radar measures speed by tracking how a moving object changes the signal it reflects. The LM1 uses it to give you fast, convenient speed readings, up to 199 mph, during your practice sessions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
